      "notes": {
        "public": "",
        "value": "<h2>Printed Statblock</h2><p><strong>Hit Dice:</strong> 9d8+27 (67 hp)</p><p><strong>Initiative:</strong> +5</p><p><strong>Speed:</strong> 30 ft. in scale mail (4 squares); base 40 ft.</p><p><strong>Armor Class:</strong> 20 (-1 size, +1 Agy, +4 natural, +6 +2 scale mail ), touch 10, flat-footed 19</p><p><strong>Base Attack/Grapple:</strong> +9/+17</p><p><strong>Attack:</strong> +3 greatsword +15 melee (3d6+9/19-20) or +3 composite longbow (+4) +12 ranged (2d6+7/x3)</p><p><strong>Full Attack:</strong> +3 greatsword +15/+10 melee (3d6+9/19-20) or +3 composite longbow (+4) +12/+7 ranged (2d6+7/x3)</p><p><strong>Space/Reach:</strong> 10 ft./10 ft.</p><p><strong>Special Attacks:</strong> -</p><p><strong>Special Qualities:</strong> Darkvision 60 ft., heritage qualities</p><p><strong>Saves:</strong> Fort +11, Ref +4, Will +6</p><p><strong>Abilities:</strong> Str 19, Agy 12, Sta 16, Int 13, Spt 10, Cha 8</p><p><strong>Skills:</strong> Balance +0, Bluff +3, Concentration +8, Intimidate +13, Knowledge (arcana) +7, Knowledge (military tactics) +7, Listen +7, Spellcraft +13, Spot +5, Stealth +0 (-4 to hide), Survival +3</p><p><strong>Feats:</strong> Cleave, Great Fortitude, Improved Initiative, Power Attack</p><p><strong>Area:</strong> Any</p><p><strong>Organization:</strong> 1 per 50-100 wyrmkin; or unit (10-100), squadron (40-400), or army (100-1000)</p><p><strong>Treasure:</strong> Standard (weapons and armor)</p><p><strong>Advancement:</strong> 10-18 HD (Large); 19-27 HD (Huge); or by character class</p><p><strong>Level Adjustment:</strong> +3</p><p><strong>Manual boundary:</strong> situational targeting, tactical decisions, and exceptional special abilities remain GM-adjudicated unless an embedded item provides a roll or effect.</p>"
